Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:43:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] v8: kFlyWebCacheEpoch 37 -> 38 for FlyWeb 3.2.0

The 3.2.0 changes V8 on top of 3.1.4 with the 8078 branch and M159
fixes in softmac seguridad/pendiente/brave-core/0001-0004 (d68cecd900,
a0f2c9f8c3 and 51512210b3 change bytecode and optimized code;
ceb90d38eb changes the code cache format) and with LIBC_MATH in
base/ieee754.cc (renderer-webgl 0003), which changes the Math builtins.
One epoch for the whole release, so code cached by 3.1.4 is not reused.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwmK2hjxRPyuefYzGRoZRk
